  "tokens": {
    "YEAR": "2026",
    "PROJECT_NAME": "torn-forum-command-center",
    "PROJECT_SUMMARY": "A Tampermonkey and Torn PDA userscript that replaces Torn's tiny subscribed-threads sidebar box with a full forum workspace: folders, tags, pinned threads, read/unread tracking, catch-up since last visit, locally saved reply drafts, and search across the threads you follow. Reads the official Torn API v2 forum endpoints with a Minimal-access key; all organization stays in local script storage."
